<cell>Match each function with its graph.
<ol>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = \displaystyle 3 \cos\left( \frac{x^2+y^2}{4} \right)</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = 3 - x^2 - y^2</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = \displaystyle \frac{3}{1 + x^2 + y^2}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>f(x,y) = 3 - \sqrt{x^2+y^2}</m>
</li>
</ol>
(You can drag the images to rotate them.)</cell>
